---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Annabel paints figures drawn from feminine archetypes and dreams, in acrylic on canvas, in Fort Lauderdale."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-site px-5 py-16 sm:px-12 sm:py-24">
		<h1 class="font-display text-[32px] font-light leading-[1.1] text-ink sm:text-[48px]">
			About
		</h1>

		<div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 sm:mt-16 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,360px)_1fr] sm:gap-16">
			<img
				class="aspect-[2/3] w-full object-cover"
				src="/annabel-about.jpg"
				width="1200"
				height="1800"
				alt="Annabel and her fiancé standing on a stone bridge beside a lake."
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
			/>

			<div>
				<p class="max-w-prose text-charcoal">
					I paint people. Contemporary, figurative work with an editorial, surrealist edge.
					I have painted since I was a child, and the images I keep returning to come from
					feminine archetypes and from what surfaces in my dreams. Acrylic on canvas,
					mostly. The figures feel familiar and slightly out of place, like pieces of my own
					life set down on canvas and left to live in someone else&rsquo;s home.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-charcoal">
					For a long time it stayed private. Painting was a hobby, and hobbies are supposed
					to fit in a closet. Mine did not. The canvases went from a corner to a wall to
					most of a small apartment, and my fianc&eacute; Preston, stepping around a six-foot
					alligator painting in the kitchen, eventually made the case that other people might
					want to live with these too. He was right, though I&rsquo;d have preferred he was
					right about a smaller painting.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-charcoal">
					So here it is. I paint because I love it, and I would rather these pieces be on
					your wall than stacked against mine.
				</p>

				<div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
					<a class="btn" href="/originals">Shop originals</a>
					<a class="btn-secondary" href="/commissions">Request a commission</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
